# Example environment file for i am Architect.
#
# This is a TEMPLATE ONLY - it contains no real credentials. Copy it to
# `.env` (already gitignored - see .gitignore) and fill in real values
# for your own local/server use. Never commit a real `.env` file.
#
# IMPORTANT - read src/engine/ai/README.md's "Security boundary" section
# before setting this anywhere. This project is currently a pure
# client-side Vite SPA with no backend/server code. OPENAI_API_KEY must
# only ever be supplied to a trusted, server-side process (e.g. a future
# backend/proxy endpoint that calls OpenAI on the app's behalf) - never
# to anything that runs in, or gets bundled into, the browser. Nothing
# in this repository currently reads this variable automatically; it
# exists so a future server-side integration has a documented name and
# a safe local place to put a real value.

# Your OpenAI API key. Get one at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here
